WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.270 --> 00:00:02.100
- [Announcer] Hello and welcome

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.440
to "The Kelly Clarkson Show."

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:08.952
Give it up for today's
celebrity host, Sunita Mani!

00:00:08.952 --> 00:00:13.952
(upbeat music)
(audience cheering)

00:00:31.055 --> 00:00:31.888
- Hi.

00:00:32.799 --> 00:00:33.632
Hello.

00:00:34.839 --> 00:00:38.139
Welcome to "The Kelly Clarkson Show."

00:00:38.139 --> 00:00:40.470
(Sunita laughs)

00:00:40.470 --> 00:00:42.750
No, you are not seeing things.

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:45.233
I am, in fact, not Kelly.

00:00:45.233 --> 00:00:46.066
(audience laughs)

00:00:46.066 --> 00:00:47.340
She's not feeling great today.

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:50.215
So it's me, Sunita Mani, to the rescue.

00:00:50.215 --> 00:00:51.388
(audience cheering)

00:00:51.388 --> 00:00:54.150
(Sunita laughs)

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:56.520
I've always wanted to host a show,

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:58.980
and with my new movie
"Spirited," in theaters,

00:00:58.980 --> 00:01:01.950
and just starting to stream on Apple TV+,

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:04.113
it seems like the perfect timing, right?

00:01:04.113 --> 00:01:07.080
(audience cheering)

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:10.110
And it's not just me,
it's a full cast takeover,

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:11.810
with Ryan Reynolds,

00:01:11.810 --> 00:01:13.479
Will Ferrell,
(audience cheering)

00:01:13.479 --> 00:01:15.146
and Octavia Spencer.

00:01:18.107 --> 00:01:21.150
But first, this show
always starts with music.

00:01:21.150 --> 00:01:25.590
And since I unfortunately
can't do Kelly-level vocals,

00:01:25.590 --> 00:01:29.130
I'm leaving it to the pro
with a Kellyoke Encore.

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:31.170
Here's Kelly and her band, Y'all,

00:01:31.170 --> 00:01:34.110
along with the Southern
California Trojan Marching Band,

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:36.623
with "Seven Nation Army"
by the White Stripes.

00:01:36.623 --> 00:01:39.438
(audience cheering)

00:01:39.438 --> 00:01:42.438
(upbeat rock music)

00:01:46.664 --> 00:01:49.904
♪ I'm gonna fight 'em all ♪

00:01:49.904 --> 00:01:54.240
♪ A seven nation army
couldn't hold me back ♪

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:57.688
♪ They're gonna rip it off ♪

00:01:57.688 --> 00:02:02.112
♪ Taking their time right behind my back ♪

00:02:02.112 --> 00:02:04.904
♪ And I'm talking to myself at night ♪

00:02:04.904 --> 00:02:09.904
♪ Because I can't forget ♪

00:02:10.265 --> 00:02:12.685
♪ Back and forth through my mind ♪

00:02:12.685 --> 00:02:15.364
♪ Behind a cigarette ♪

00:02:15.364 --> 00:02:17.628
(audience cheering)

00:02:17.628 --> 00:02:20.480
♪ And the message coming from my eyes ♪

00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:24.768
♪ Says, Leave it alone ♪

00:02:24.768 --> 00:02:29.028
♪ Leave it alone ♪

00:02:29.028 --> 00:02:32.518
♪ I'm going to Wichita ♪

00:02:32.518 --> 00:02:36.826
♪ Far from this opera forevermore ♪

00:02:36.826 --> 00:02:40.199
♪ I'm gonna work the straw ♪

00:02:40.199 --> 00:02:44.628
♪ Make the sweat drip out of every pore ♪

00:02:44.628 --> 00:02:47.552
♪ And I'm bleeding, and I'm
bleeding, and I'm bleeding ♪

00:02:47.552 --> 00:02:48.960
♪ Right before the Lord ♪

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:52.665
(audience cheering)

00:02:52.665 --> 00:02:55.197
♪ All the words are gonna bleed from me ♪

00:02:55.197 --> 00:03:00.197
♪ And I will sing no more ♪

00:03:00.273 --> 00:03:02.973
♪ And the stains coming from my blood ♪

00:03:02.973 --> 00:03:05.586
♪ Tell me, Go back home ♪

00:03:05.586 --> 00:03:07.546
(audience cheering)

00:03:07.546 --> 00:03:11.267
♪ Go back home ♪

00:03:11.267 --> 00:03:13.895
♪ Go back home ♪

00:03:13.895 --> 00:03:16.978
(audience cheering)

00:03:20.815 --> 00:03:21.648
- One more time,

00:03:21.648 --> 00:03:23.964
give it up for Kelly and her band, Y'all,

00:03:23.964 --> 00:03:24.930
(audience cheering)

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:26.220
along with the University

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:29.198
of Southern California
Trojan marching band.

00:03:29.198 --> 00:03:31.374
(audience cheering)

